							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "### Vehicle registration\n\n**Subject:** Vehicle Administration.\n\n**Counts toward:** The specific {{gtClass:PpVehicle|label=vehicle}} as a {{gtClass:PpValue|label=valued object}}.\n\nRegistration, inspection, title, plate, and DMV costs can share this subject unless and until you decide more distinction is valuable enough to incur the additional complexity cost."
						},
