							"string" : "### Parking during a trip\n\n**Subject:** Parking, or the particular parking {{gtClass:PpEvent|label=event}} or facility when useful.\n\n**Counts toward:** Travel.\n\n**Other context:** Link the specific Trip rather than reducing it to a tag."
