							"string" : "### Insurance\n\n**Subject:** {{gtClass:PpValue|label=Insurance}} as a value; split into Vehicle vs. Personal Liability if that matters to you\n\nThe {{gtClass:VsAgreement|label=agreement}} points to the covered vehicle, property, or umbrella concern.\n\n**Counts toward:** Insurance Protection.\n\n**Other context:** The insurance {{gtClass:VsAgreement|label=agreement}}."
