							"paragraphStyle" : {
								"__type" : "textStyle"
							},
							"string" : "1. Does a real domain object already exist?\n2. What particular thing is the subject?\n3. Would an established `PpValue` serve as the generic subject?\n4. What does the subject count toward?\n5. Who benefits?\n6. Is a Dynabook object type like a {{gtClass:CwSoftware|label=software product}}, {{gtClass:PpVehicle|label=vehicle}}, {{gtClass:VsAgreement|label=agreement}}, {{gtClass:PpEvent|label=event}}, {{gtClass:PpInventory|label=inventory}}, {{gtClass:PpProject|label=project}}, or {{gtClass:MpPerson|label=person}}  involved?\n7. Must any relationship be effective-dated or allocated?\n8. Did search reveal an overlapping {{gtClass:PpValue}} before we created another?"
						}
					]
